<title>USA: Moto Photo Q4 Dec 31 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Moto Photo Q4 Dec 31 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.04     loss	 $0.72</p>
<p> Net	 profit	   406     loss	 5,593</p>
<p> Revs			12,382		   11,818</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,786		    7,786</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	 $0.10     loss	 $0.69</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 1,074     loss	 5,674</p>
<p> Revs			43,288		   42,218</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,786		    7,687</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Moto Photo Inc net income for the fourth quarter of 1995 included a $5.8 million charge to write down the book value of 32 company stores.</p>
<p>The fourth quarter of 1996 included a $464,522 write down.</p>
<p>Earnings per share were reported after the payment of preferred dividends.  Preferred dividends for the fourth quarter of 1996 were $71,813, as compared to $73,004 for the fourth quarter of 1995.  Preferred dividends were $289,290 for fiscal year 1996, as compared to $307,354 for fiscal 1995.</p>
<p>The fiscal year 1995 included a one time adjustment to common share earnings of $673,219.</p>
